 (4, 'HABIBA', '0:30', 'The doors open', 'Inside: everything you own — but no idea what to wear today.'),
 (5, 'HABIBA', '0:38', 'Title', 'This is Closet: an intelligent wardrobe that learns how you dress — it knows what you own, what is clean, the weather and your calendar, and suggests outfits from your own clothes. Today: Sprint 1, a live demo, the design, testing, and what we learned.'),
 (8, 'HABIBA', '1:00', 'Sprint 1: a working closet', 'Sprint 1 ran from October 11 to 24: a working closet. We committed to 15 stories and 48 points and finished all of them — sign-in, the style quiz, adding and browsing pieces, laundry and availability, and the planner.'),
